OL,4,CBurnham's Brexit reset deal at risk    
OL,5,Cunless UK cuts European student fees,  
OL,6,CEU officials say -FThe bloc wants its  
OL,7,Fstudents to be charged the same        
OL,8,Ftuition as British students - and has  
OL,9,Fgiven the UK six months to agree or    
OL,10,Fnegotiate an alternative.     GSee P104
OL,12,CUK and EU to agree youth mobility      
OL,13,Cscheme, BBC understands -FThe scheme   
OL,14,Fis expected to be approved at Friday's 
OL,15,FUK-EU summit, with new deals on food   
OL,16,Ftrade and carbon emissions also on the 
OL,17,Ftable.                        GSee P105
